/* Importing into Photos */
"Phone Photo Backup is not allowed to use Photos. Allow it in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Photos, then try again." = "“手机照片备份”没有使用“照片”的权限。请在“系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 照片”中允许后再试。";
"Imported from Old Phones" = "从旧手机导入";
"There are no backups in the backup location yet." = "备份位置里还没有备份。";
"The import record could not be saved: %@" = "无法保存导入记录：%@";
